<!-- From https://github.com/mcanouil/quarto-issues-experiments/tree/main/test-gallery/gallery ; and https://www.cynthiahqy.com/posts/masonry-gallery/#fn1-->
```{=html}
<style type="text/css">
.grid-gallery {
  columns: 4 200px;
  column-gap: 0.5rem;
  width: 90%;
  margin: 0 auto;
  max-height: 600px;  /* adjust until only 2 items fit per column */
}
.grid-item {
  width: 150px;
  margin: 0 0.5rem 0.5rem 0;
  display: inline-block;
  border-radius: 5px;
  background: #FFFFFF;
  border: 1px solid #333;
  border-color: hsla(0, 0%, 0%, 0.5);
  border-radius: 5px;
  break-inside: avoid;

}
img.grid-item {
  width: 100%;
}
img.grid-item:hover {
  transform: scale(1.025);
}

figcaption {
    display: none;
}
.quarto-figure {
    margin-bottom: 0px;
    }
</style>
```

::: {.grid-gallery}
<% for (const item of items) { %>
::: {}
![**<%= item.title %>**](<%= item.thumbnail %>){.grid-item .lightbox loading="lazy" group="quarto-grid-gallery" description="<%= item.subtitle %>"}
:::
<% } %>
:::